ot and test dependencies\n7. ✓ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only modified ShipmentController.kt (added confirm endpoint), ApiError.kt (added error code), and ShipmentControllerTest.kt (added tests)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n- **ApiError.kt**: Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` error code to enum. Necessary because ticket requires 409 for CANCELLED state. Follows naming convention of existing codes.\n\n- **ShipmentController.kt**: Added `confirm` endpoint with:\n  - Path mapping to `/{shipmentId}/confirm`\n  - ResourceNotFoundException for missing shipment (404)\n  - State machine using Kotlin `when` to handle each status:\n    - CREATED → transitions to CONFIRMED\n    - CONFIRMED → returns unchanged (idempotent)\n    - CANCELLED → throws ConflictException with error code (409)\n  - Saves updated shipment to repository\n  - Returns ResponseEntity.ok() with the saved shipment\n  - Necessary to implement the feature. No unrelated changes.\n\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt**: Added four test cases:\n  - `confirms a created shipment transitions to confirmed` — verifies state transition and HTTP 200\n  - `confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change` — verifies idempotency\n  - `rejects confirmation of a cancelled shipment with conflict` — verifies 409 and error code\n  - `rejects confirmation of unknown shipment as not found` — verifies 404 and error code\n  - Necessary for test coverage. Follows existing MockMvc pattern. All assertions match ticket requirements.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests pass, no forbidden files modified.\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint with idempotent confirmation, state validation, and standard error handling for invalid states and missing shipments.\n\nChanged       ApiError.kt: Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code to support 409 response for invalid state transitions\n              ShipmentController.kt: Added confirm endpoint that transitions CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotently handles CONFIRMED, rejects CANCELLED with 409\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt: Added four tests covering successful confirmation, idempotency, CANCELLED rejection, and missing shipment handling\n\nTests         confirms a created shipment transitions to confirmed: Verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition\n              confirms an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change: Verifies idempotent behavior\n              rejects confirmation of a cancelled shipment with conflict: Verifies 409 Conflict for CANCELLED state\n              rejects confirmation of unknown shipment as not found: Verifies 404 Not Found for missing shipment\n\nVerification  ./mvnw test from sample-service/ completed with BUILD SUCCESS\n              17 tests run: 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped\n              All 5 existing shipment tests passed + 4 new confirmation tests passed\n\nNot done      (none - all acceptance criteria satisfied)\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5481,"cache_read_input_tokens":24242,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5481},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c3f2bc9a-5da4-400e-8f5b-cfe116ab4fb1","uuid":"db8c6527-274c-448b-bac5-8a71106b961e","timestamp":"2026-09-26T16:43:39.794Z","request_id":"req_011CfSPMUP7doHs2ytkY982e"}
